data: {"id": "de1103fb61164ba3-thinking-parallel_evidence-1820", "run_id": "de1103fb61164ba3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 生命周期与状态 (Kubernetes + Metrics)**\n   - `kubectl_describe` + `kubectl_get_yaml`: Pod phase=`Running`，`Ready=False` (`ContainersNotReady`)，`ContainersReady=False`。\n   - 容器 `app`: `State=Running`, `Started=2026-09-14 11:46:39`, `Restart Count=0`, `Ready=False`。\n   - Prometheus `kube_pod_status_phase=1` (Running), `restarts=0`。与 K8s describe 一致，**确认 Pod 自启动以来从未重启，但始终未 Ready**。\n\n2. **Readiness Probe 配置 (K8s YAML)**\n   - `readinessProbe`: `http-get http://:18081/ready`, `delay=5s`, `", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789389164886, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

